-- ===== THE TARGET, LIMB (a): THE CLAUSE AS SH 2274 PRINTED IT =====

-- Item (11) of section 2 opens with the words naming section 39; its item (ב) puts the paragraph after paragraph (2) of subsection (ב).
-- ext:[sh2274-p245] | (11) בסעיף 39 –
-- ext:[sh2274-p245] | (ב) בסעיף קטן (ב), אחרי פסקה (2) יבוא:
-- ext:[sh2274-p245] | ״(2א) מסר מידע כוזב או מטעה בבקשה לקבלת רישיון לפי סעיף 5, או
-- ext:[sh2274-p245] | בדיווח לרשות לפי סעיף 27.״;
-- ext:[sh2274-p245] | (2א) מסר מידע כוזב או מטעה בבקשה לקבלת רישיון לפי סעיף 5, או בדיווח לרשות לפי סעיף 27. (the two printed lines joined, without the marks)
-- The clause is typed as ONE string that ends with the period the page prints inside the closing mark; the semicolon after the closing mark is the instruction item's own and is not part of the clause.
-- It is also typed as the list of its words split on spaces: the commas and the final period stay attached to the words as printed. 18 words.
-- The row types the count of the word סעיף among them: 2.
`the clause as SH 2274 printed it` MEANS
    `A printed clause` WITH
        `the instrument that printed it` IS `SH 2274`
        `the printed page it is on` IS 245
        `the item that prints it` IS "(11)(ב)"
        `the place it is printed for` IS `paragraph 2-alef of subsection 39(bet)`
        `its words as one string` IS "(2א) מסר מידע כוזב או מטעה בבקשה לקבלת רישיון לפי סעיף 5, או בדיווח לרשות לפי סעיף 27."
        `its words split on spaces` IS
            LIST "(2א)", "מסר", "מידע", "כוזב", "או", "מטעה", "בבקשה", "לקבלת", "רישיון", "לפי", "סעיף", "5,", "או", "בדיווח", "לרשות", "לפי", "סעיף", "27."
        `the count the row types` IS 2

`the instruction of SH 2274 item (11)(bet)` MEANS
    `An instruction that writes a paragraph` WITH
        `the instrument` IS `SH 2274`
        `the printed page it is on` IS 245
        `the section of the instrument` IS 2
        `the item` IS "(11)(ב)"
        `the place it names` IS `subsection 39(bet)`
        `the paragraph it prints the clause after` IS "(2)"
        `the clause it prints` IS `the clause as SH 2274 printed it`

